{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/6c79e2b18a68228764013ba77ef7389e.poster.avif?t=1774529826\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/6c79e2b18a68228764013ba77ef7389e.webm?t=1774529826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/6c79e2b18a68228764013ba77ef7389e.mp4?t=1774529826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drink Factory Simulator</strong> is a detailed simulation game where you build your own beverage empire, develop recipes, and expand into a massive production facility. \ud83c\udf79<br>Start with a small mixer, discover the right combinations, grow your production line, and fulfill customer orders on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in multiplayer with your friends, manage the factory together, and handle deliveries as a team! \ud83d\udc65\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage production lines during the day, test your recipes in analysis mode at night, complete deliveries in the open world, and enjoy the ultimate social experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/1967cd68fd347f6cf190c6b4f3152c41.avif?t=1774529826\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Manage the factory and make deliveries with 1\u20133 friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2c <strong>Discover &amp; Develop Recipes</strong> \u2013 Experiment with soda, cola, energy drinks, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfed <strong>Grow &amp; Manage Your Factory</strong> \u2013 Expand from a small mixer to fully automated production plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Fulfill Orders on Time</strong> \u2013 Ensure customer satisfaction with high-quality production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Analysis &amp; Experiment Mode</strong> \u2013 Test your recipes, identify correct and wrong ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfea <strong>Store Management</strong> \u2013 Open your own shop, organize shelves, and sell at the cashier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udefb <strong>Open World Deliveries</strong> \u2013 Drive your truck to deliver large shipments to the port or single orders to local stores</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/cdcc7c15b37d842f7851266d37701dc8.poster.avif?t=1774529826\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/cdcc7c15b37d842f7851266d37701dc8.webm?t=1774529826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 Multiplayer (Up to 3 Players)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the factory, complete orders, and make deliveries in the open world together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance the fun with social interaction and co-op gameplay</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2c Discover &amp; Develop Recipes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with soda, cola, energy drinks, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right ratios to earn higher scores and bigger orders</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfed Grow &amp; Manage Your Factory</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new machines and expand your production line</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress from a small mixer to massive automated facilities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 Order System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill customer demands on time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase satisfaction with consistent quality</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/924e3d1f69d01cc5722d9eabda1066f3.poster.avif?t=1774529826\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/924e3d1f69d01cc5722d9eabda1066f3.webm?t=1774529826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/924e3d1f69d01cc5722d9eabda1066f3.mp4?t=1774529826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Analysis &amp; Experiment Mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your recipes and see correct vs. incorrect ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use trial-and-error to discover the perfect beverages</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfea Store Management</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize shelves and handle cashier sales</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913840/extras/6f0f82c178d09793b570276b73516fdc.poster.avif?t=1774529826\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea